        ZmanMethod("sof-zman-shma-mga72-minutes", "shema", "Latest Shema Magen Avraham 72 minutes \u00b7 Day: Dawn 72 minutes \u2192 Nightfall 72 minutes", false, false, false, true, true, explicitElevation = false, sourceMethod = "getSofZmanShmaMGA72Minutes", hebrewLabel = "סוף זמן קריאת שמע מגן אברהם 72 minutes", definition = "3 temporal hours after the specified day begins. A full-day temporal hour is one twelfth of that interval. When enabled, the library’s supported half-day policy uses six morning/afternoon hours around the profile chatzos. Day: Dawn 72 minutes → Nightfall 72 minutes", sourceDefinition = "This method returns the latest zman krias shema (time to recite Shema in the morning) according to the opinion of the Magen Avraham (MGA) based on alos being getAlos72Minutes() 72 minutes before sunrise. This time is 3 getShaahZmanis72Minutes() shaos zmaniyos (solar hours) after dawn based on the opinion of the MGA that the day is calculated from a dawn of 72 minutes before sunrise to nightfall of 72 minutes after sunset. This returns the time of 3 getShaahZmanis72Minutes() after dawn.") { c -> c.getSofZmanShmaMGA72Minutes() },
