        ZmanMethod("candle-lighting", "candles", "Candle Lighting", false, false, true, false, false, explicitElevation = false, sourceMethod = "getCandleLighting", hebrewLabel = "הדלקת נרות", definition = "Before-sunset candle lighting subtracts your explicit fixed-minute offset from sea-level sunset. Applicable holiday transitions instead use your explicitly chosen nightfall calculation. Friday evenings retain the before-sunset rule.", sourceDefinition = "A method to return candle lighting time, calculated as getCandleLightingOffset() minutes before getSeaLevelSunset() sea level sunset. This will return the time for any day of the week, since it can be used to calculate candle lighting time for Yom Tov (mid-week holidays) as well. Elevation adjustments are intentionally not performed by this method, but you can calculate it by passing the elevation adjusted sunset to Duration).") { c -> c.getCandleLighting() },
